  - graph certificates
  - self-orthogonal binary codes
abstract: >-
  A written binary-rank and graph/subspace reduction plus exact finite
  enumeration gives a complete seventeen-row coordinate cover for ten-variable
  constant-one Fourier components with eight negative pairs, seven positive
  quartets, three exceptional singleton values and cube divisibility by eight.
  A standard-library-only checker verifies literal graph transports and all
  19112 selection instances. Minimal orbit counts, constant-two classification,
  Boolean-function extension and the global fourteen-variable problem are not
  resolved. Substantial AI assistance is disclosed; novelty, formal verification
  and human peer review are not established.
